'''[[repetitive]] [[strain]] [[injury]]'''  (abbreviated as ''[[RSI]]'')

# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} injury to [[muscle]]s and [[tendon]]s caused by [[continuous]] repetitive use of [[particular]] [[muscle]] [[group]]s, [[especially]] in one's arms and hands, for example by using a [[keyboard]] and/or [[mouse]], playing a [[musical instrument]] or working on an [[assembly line]]

